 PARITY MAP (web source → native)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  useCommandHistory / useVehicles    → CommandSource → CommandModel (P1/S8). The view
                                       never performs HTTP; id = vehicleId ?? vehicles[0].
  STATUS_MAP {success,failed,pending} → CommandStatusCatalog.feedVisual:
     success → checkmark.circle.fill · #22c55e · info
     failed  → xmark.circle.fill     · #ef4444 · critical
     pending → clock.fill            · #f59e0b · warning
  DEFAULT_STATUS (unknown token)     → terminal.fill · #6b7280 · info (exact, case-
                                       sensitive lookup parity with the web object).
  formatCommandName(/_/→' ', \b\w→UP)→ CommandNameFormatter.format (boundary-only
                                       upper-casing; interior left untouched).
  CompactView (size.cols<=1)         → CommandCompactRow + CommandStatusBadge; variant
     success→success / failed→danger / else→warning; label Success/Failed/Pending.
  WidgetEventFeed(maxItems=10)       → CommandEventFeed + CommandFeedBuilder.feed
                                       (newest-first sort + 10-item cap).
  lastEntry = list[0] (unsorted)     → CommandModel.latest = items.first (source order).
  WidgetShell loading/empty/error    → CommandModel.Phase loading/empty/error/content,
     + DataFreshness (updatedAt/isStale) + CommandConnection live/stale/offline chip
       + banner (covers the required stale + offline states).
  i18n t(key, fallback)              → CommandStrings facade → "CommandHistoryWidget"
                                       table. Per-row status subtitle echoes the raw
                                       backend token verbatim (web cmd.status = data).

